{"3749760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sushi On Wheels", "steam_appid": 3749760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your grandmother passes away and leaves you a sushi truck, it’s up to you to realize her dream of opening a restaurant. Set in Japan’s real life Izu Peninsula, use your grandmother’s handed down recipes to serve a small island community that’s shaped by food, festivals, and local vendors. <br><br>Earn enough success to complete your grandmother’s dream and open a permanent restaurant, take part in major festivals, and become the best sushi restaurant Izu has ever seen!<br><br><br><strong>Prepare Your Truck &amp; Build Your Reputation</strong> <strong>🚚</strong>Choose the finest ingredients, ready your tools, and decide which mouthwatering creations will tempt customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/20767ca71e65dd89152197bdfbbf1930.poster.avif?t=1787996572\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/20767ca71e65dd89152197bdfbbf1930.webm?t=1787996572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/20767ca71e65dd89152197bdfbbf1930.mp4?t=1787996572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Real life Japan 🌸</strong>Follow winding roads, visit vibrant markets, and find hidden gems across the Izu Peninsula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749760/extras/edd29f48b5481dd9dc4ed8d73efcd407.poste